  "reasoning": "The defendant introduced others to issue false VAT special invoices for profit, resulting in tax loss and the use of those invoices for tax deduction, which constitutes the crime of virtual issuance of VAT special invoices (虚开增值税专用发票) used to obtain illegal tax deductions. Additionally, a large number of forged general and ordinary VAT invoices were found, indicating the crime of forging invoices (伪造发票). No other distinct crimes are evident from the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]虚开增值税专用发票、用于骗取抵扣税款发票;伪造发票<eoa>"
